{
	"title": "Comparer deux nombres par leur différence",
	"description": "Signe de a − b pour comparer deux fractions ; A = x² + k², B = 2kx : A − B = (x − k)² ⩾ 0",
	"grades": ["2"],
	"theme": "Calcul littéral",
	"domain": "Inégalités",
	"subdomain": "Comparer",
	"level": 1,
	"delay": 60,
	"status": "draft",
	"shared": {
		"cleanCoefficients": true
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "On veut comparer $a=\\dfrac{ {{p}} }{ {{q}} }$ et $b=\\dfrac{ {{r}} }{ {{s}} }$ en calculant leur différence.\n\n$$a-b=?$$\n\nOn en déduit :\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- $a<b$\n- $a>b$\n- $a=b$\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "3..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "1..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "3..9!q"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "1..8"
				},
				{
					"name": "t",
					"expression": "eval:min(max((p)*(s)-(r)*(q),0),1)"
				}
			],
			"conditions": [
				"gcd(p,q) == 1",
				"gcd(r,s) == 1",
				"(p)*(s) != (r)*(q)",
				"p < q",
				"r < s",
				"abs((p)/(q)-(r)/(s)) < 0.2"
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(p)/(q)-(r)/(s)}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{t}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**Comparer par la différence** : si $a-b>0$ alors $a>b$ ; si $a-b<0$ alors $a<b$.",
					"$$a-b=\\dfrac{ {{eval:(p)*(s)}} }{ {{eval:(q)*(s)}} }-\\dfrac{ {{eval:(r)*(q)}} }{ {{eval:(q)*(s)}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:(p)/(q)-(r)/(s)}}}$$",
					"La différence est {{if:t>0|positive|négative}}, donc $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{a{{if:t>0|>|<}}b}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Pour tout réel $x$, on pose $A=x^2+{{eval:(k)^2}}$ et $B={{eval:2*(k)}}x$.\n\nComplète :\n\n$$A-B=(x-?)^2$$\n\nOn en déduit que, pour tout réel $x$ :\n\n```choix\nmelanger: non\n- $A\\geqslant B$\n- $A\\leqslant B$\n- cela dépend de $x$\n```",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "2..9"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{k}}"
				},
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "0"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On calcule la différence et on reconnaît une identité remarquable :",
					"$$A-B=x^2-{{eval:2*(k)}}x+{{eval:(k)^2}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{(x-{{k}})^2}$$",
					"Un carré est toujours positif ou nul : $A-B\\geqslant 0$, donc $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{A\\geqslant B}$ pour tout réel $x$ (égalité pour $x={{k}}$)."
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "3/7 − 5/12 = 1/84 > 0 : a > b",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"q": "7",
				"p": "3",
				"s": "12",
				"r": "5",
				"t": "1"
			},
			"answers": ["\\frac{1}{84}", "1"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : b − a (−1/84)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"q": "7",
				"p": "3",
				"s": "12",
				"r": "5",
				"t": "1"
			},
			"answers": ["-\\frac{1}{84}", "1"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : conclusion inversée",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"q": "7",
				"p": "3",
				"s": "12",
				"r": "5",
				"t": "1"
			},
			"answers": ["\\frac{1}{84}", "0"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "k = 3 : (x − 3)², A ⩾ B",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": {
				"k": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["3", "0"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : « cela dépend de x »",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": {
				"k": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["3", "2"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : (x − 6)²",
			"variationIndex": 1,
			"variables": {
				"k": "3"
			},
			"answers": ["6", "0"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		}
	]
}
